menu "DEV Serial Harness"

    config DEV_SERIAL_HARNESS
        bool "Serial test harness (scripted control channel on UART0)"
        default n
        help
            Compiles in the agent/script-drivable test harness: a low-priority
            command task reading line commands from UART0 (H> prefix) to
            inject input events, drive the transport and dump state, for the
            headless test board. No harness code is compiled in when off;
            the playable firmware is unaffected.

endmenu
